10
00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:46.401
"It's Rocket Girl!"

11
00:00:47.842 --> 00:00:50.864
Mr. Presto was about to make a little girl's lollipop disappear.

12
00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:56.628
"One, two, three "Stop right there, Mr.

13
00:00:56.668 --> 00:00:58.269
Presto!" Roxy yelled.

14
00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:02.012
Mr. Presto spun around, and the little girl ran away.

15
00:01:03.624 --> 00:01:04.764
"Rocket Girl!"

16
00:01:05.085 --> 00:01:05.545
said Mr.

17
00:01:05.605 --> 00:01:08.245
Presto. "I was hoping you would appear.

18
