"No, you're not," said Roxy.

25
00:01:32.244 --> 00:01:33.825
Mr. Presto raised an eyebrow.

26
00:01:33.845 --> 00:01:35.306
"I'm not?

27
00:01:36.187 --> 00:01:37.808
Who's going to stop me?"

28
00:01:37.828 --> 00:01:40.670
"I am," said Roxy.

29
00:01:42.912 --> 00:01:44.033
She ran toward Mr.

30
00:01:44.073 --> 00:01:46.034
Presto. Mr.

31
