She felt someone tap her on the shoulder.

47
00:02:30.629 --> 00:02:32.830
"Here I am!"

48
00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:33.590
said Mr.

49
00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:35.991
Presto. Roxy spun around.

50
00:02:36.011 --> 00:02:37.972
Poof! Mr.

51
