53
00:02:42.473 --> 00:02:45.135
"Hey!" she yelled.

54
00:02:45.155 --> 00:02:47.355
"Mr. Presto!

55
00:02:47.656 --> 00:02:49.056
Why don't you come out and face me?

56
00:02:50.317 --> 00:02:51.837
Or are you too scared?"

57
00:02:52.638 --> 00:02:53.778
Poof! Mr.

58
00:02:53.818 --> 00:02:55.118
Presto appeared nearby.

59
00:02:55.139 --> 00:02:58.560
"I'm the world's greatest magician!"

60
00:02:58.940 --> 00:02:59.380
said Mr.

61
00:02:59.441 --> 00:03:03.784
Presto. "I'm not scared of a silly little girl."

62
00:03:08.026 --> 00:03:09.127
Roxy glared at Mr.

63
00:03:09.167 --> 00:03:12.249
Presto. "A silly little girl?

64
00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:14.831
You're going to regret saying that!"

65
00:03:16.272 --> 00:03:17.453
Roxy shot toward Mr.

66
00:03:17.493 --> 00:03:18.494
Presto like a rocket.

67
00:03:18.514 --> 00:03:21.176
"Presto!" said Mr.

68
00:03:21.216 --> 00:03:24.578
Presto. A big black box appeared in front of him.

69
00:03:25.398 --> 00:03:27.480
Roxy was flying too fast to stop.

70
00:03:28.328 --> 00:03:29.991
She slammed right into the box.

71
